@startuml
title UAE PASS Mobile Login via Keycloak (Authorization Code Flow with PKCE)

box "Mobile Device" #lightblue
actor "User" as User
participant "Mobile App (YourApp)" as App
participant "Embedded WebView" as WebView
participant "UAE PASS Mobile App" as UAEPASSApp
end box

box "CDBC Backend" #lightgreen
participant "Keycloak Server" as KC
end box

box "UAE PASS Backend"
participant "UAE PASS Auth Server" as UAEPASS
end box

== Flow Type: OAuth 2.0 Authorization Code Flow with PKCE ==

User -> App: Tap "Login with UAE PASS"
App -> WebView: Open Keycloak /auth endpoint with PKCE
note right
URL: https://your-keycloak.com/realms/myrealm/protocol/openid-connect/auth  
Query Params:
  - client_id=mobile-client  
  - redirect_uri=yourapp://callback  
  - response_type=code  
  - scope=openid  
  - code_challenge=...  
  - code_challenge_method=S256  
Keycloak Client Config:
  - Access Type: public  
  - Redirect URI: yourapp://callback  
  - Web Origins: *  
  - PKCE: enabled  
end note

WebView -> KC: GET /auth with PKCE params
KC -> UAEPASS: Redirect to UAE PASS /authorize
note right
URL: https://id.uaepass.ae/idshub/authorize  
Keycloak Identity Provider:
  - Type: OIDC  
  - Alias: uaepass  
  - Token URL: https://id.uaepass.ae/idshub/token  
  - User Info URL: https://id.uaepass.ae/idshub/userinfo  
end note

WebView -> UAEPASS: Redirect via user-agent
UAEPASS -> UAEPASSApp: Launch UAE PASS App via uaepass:// scheme
User -> UAEPASSApp: Authenticate biometrically
UAEPASSApp -> UAEPASS: Confirm identity

UAEPASS -> KC: Redirect to Keycloak broker endpoint with code
note right
Redirect URI registered with UAE PASS:  
https://your-keycloak.com/realms/myrealm/broker/uaepass/endpoint  
end note

KC -> UAEPASS: POST /token to exchange code for UAE PASS token
KC -> UAEPASS: GET /userinfo to validate token and extract claims
KC -> KC: Map user via Emirates ID or other claim

KC -> App: Redirect via deep link to yourapp://callback?code=...
note right
Handled by mobile OS, not WebView.  
App intercepts URI and resumes flow.
end note

App -> KC: POST /token to exchange code for Keycloak JWT
note right
URL: https://your-keycloak.com/realms/myrealm/protocol/openid-connect/token  
Returns:
  - access_token (JWT)  
  - id_token  
  - refresh_token  
end note

@enduml

